{
  "tema": 5222,
  "slug": "anduve-anduviste",
  "titulo": "Andar in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "El sábado anduve por todo el centro.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "Andar is irregular in the preterite: stem anduv- + -e, -iste, -o, -imos, -ieron: anduve, anduviste, anduvo, anduvimos, anduvieron. Never «andé» or «andó».",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Andar** means _to walk, to go around_, and in Mexico also _to be_ (in a state or somewhere): **ando cansado**, **¿dónde andas?**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It looks like a regular -ar verb, but in the preterite it is **irregular**: the stem is **anduv-**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The endings are **-e, -iste, -o, -imos, -ieron**, with **no written accents**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "andar"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "anduve"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "anduviste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "anduvo"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "anduvimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "anduvieron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Andar en bici / en patineta** = _to ride a bike / a skateboard_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: andar copies **estar**: **estuve** → **anduve**. Both hide a **-uv-**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "El sábado ==anduve== en bici por todo el malecón de Playas.",
              "en": "On Saturday I rode my bike along the whole Playas boardwalk."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Dónde ==anduviste== toda la tarde?",
              "en": "Where were you all afternoon?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Anduvimos== tres horas por los cerros de Tecate.",
              "en": "We walked for three hours through the hills of Tecate."
            },
            {
              "es": "La semana pasada ==anduve== muy ocupado con el trabajo.",
              "en": "Last week I was really busy with work."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi tía ==anduvo== buscando sus llaves media hora.",
              "en": "My aunt spent half an hour looking for her keys."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los niños ==anduvieron== descalzos en la playa todo el día.",
              "en": "The kids went barefoot on the beach all day."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ustedes ==anduvieron== por el centro ayer?",
              "en": "Were you guys downtown yesterday?"
            }
          ]
        }
